      "topic": "staff",
      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive and attentive veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the veterinary surgeons and veterinary nurses for their patient manner and thorough medical care. Clients note that the veterinary team explains conditions clearly and treats both household pets and rescue animals with genuine dedication. The receptionists and assistants are frequently described as welcoming and accommodating."
      },
      "mentions": 21,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable consultations and routine care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the clinic as one of the most reasonably priced practices in the area for routine wellness examinations, vaccinations, and medication. Several reviewers appreciate the clear cost estimates provided before treatment. An isolated comment mentions an unexpected follow-up charge, but most find the overall fees fair."
      },
      "mentions": 16,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective treatment and accurate diagnosis"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviews report excellent clinical outcomes for pets suffering from sudden illnesses, eye infections, and chronic allergies. Pet owners appreciate prompt diagnosis and targeted therapies that provide rapid relief to dogs and cats. Several clients credit the clinical staff with successful urgent interventions and restorative therapies."
      },
      "mentions": 9,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How do clients book appointments at Ace Veterinary Clinic?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Pet owners report that appointments can be scheduled conveniently by text message as well as by calling the clinic directly."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the clinic treat rescue or feral animals?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, client reviews note that the clinic cooperates with local animal welfare groups and accepts feral cats for medical treatment and examinations."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are same-day urgent visits accommodated?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers mention that the team accommodates urgent cases on the same day when schedule allows, including Saturday morning appointments."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What routine services are provided at the clinic?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The practice provides wellness exams, vaccinations, laboratory testing, and prescription diets for dogs and cats."
      },
      "basis": "both"
